如何在Java中使用switch-case语句判断一个数字是质数还是合数？

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int num = 31; // 可以更改数字
        String type = isPrime(num) ? "prime" : "composite";
        switch (type) {
            case "prime":
                System.out.println(num + " 是质数！");
                break;
            case "composite":
                System.out.println(num + " 是合数！");
                break;
        }
    }

    public static boolean isPrime(int num) {
        if (num <= 1) {
            return false;
        }
        for (int i = 2; i < num; i++) {
            if (num % i == 0) {
                return false;
            }
        }
        return true;
    }
}
```

